      "value": "VR users have 45fps most of the time anyway and if I take my rift of it will stop rendering the game. On desktop ... well I dont really care... but you can limit the framerate to 30(maybe even 15) fps if you want to. At least on NV cards. Not sure if it can be done in realtime or if you have to restart the game.",
